<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-INDIA V SOUTH AFRICA SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA V SOUTH AFRICA SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
