<p>South Africa first innings 529-7 declared (B.McMillan 103</p>
<p>not out, G.Kirsten 103, L.Klusener 102 not out, D.Cullinan 77)</p>
<p>India first innings (S.Tendulkar 169, M.Azharuddin 115)</p>
